{
  "overview": {
    "title": "Battle Frontier",
    "desc": "Depois da Liga, o jogo muda de pergunta: não é mais vencer, é vencer sem parar. Em Diamond e Pearl isso se resume à Battle Tower. Platinum constrói a Battle Frontier inteira ao norte do Fight Area, com cinco instalações e cinco Frontier Brains; HeartGold e SoulSilver a levam para oeste de Olivine City, com entrada pela Frontier Access. Cada vitória rende Battle Points, a moeda de TM, tutor e item que os guias citam, e cada Brain derrotado deixa a sua print de prata e, na revanche, a de ouro.",
    "image": "img/Battle_Frontier_Gen4.png",
    "en": {
      "title": "Battle Frontier",
      "desc": "After the League the question changes: it is no longer winning, it is winning without stopping. In Diamond and Pearl that comes down to the Battle Tower. Platinum builds the whole Battle Frontier north of the Fight Area, with five facilities and five Frontier Brains; HeartGold and SoulSilver move it west of Olivine City, through the Frontier Access. Every win earns Battle Points, the currency for the TMs, tutors and items the guides cite, and every Brain defeated leaves their silver print and, in the rematch, the gold one."
    }
  },
